# TypeScript & Fastify

- Use Zod for all request/response validation; attach schemas to routes with `fastify-type-provider-zod`.
- Handlers: typed `ZodRouteHandler<typeof Schema>`; thin – call service, return result. Put logic in `service.ts`. Log with `request.log.info(obj, msg)`.
- Throw `HttpError(status, message)` for expected failures. Strict TS: no `any`, no `!`, no casts to silence errors.
- Protected routes: `preHandler: [authenticate]` + `getAuthUser(request)`.
- Prefer Drizzle in services; schema lives only in `src/db/schema.ts`.
